{"k": "[\"company\", [\"NAVINFLUOR\"], {}]", "v": {"symbol": "NAVINFLUOR", "name": "Navin Fluorine International Ltd", "basis": "Consolidated", "about": "Navin Fluorine International Ltd is primary engaged in producing refrigeration gases, inorganic fluorides, specialty organofluorines and offers contract research and manufacturing services. [1] Its portfolio includes 50+ fluorinated compounds developed over the years. [2]", "key_points": "Overview\n[1]\nNFIL, a part of the Padmanabh Mafatlal group, is present in the fluorochemical industry since 1967 and is one of the largest specialty fluorochemical companies and a pioneer in manufacturing of refrigerant gases in India. NFIL’s product portfolio comprises 60+ fluorinated compounds, with them finding application in various industries, like agrochemicals, pharmaceuticals, aluminium smelting, refrigeration, metal processing, abrasives, glass and ceramics. The company is currently headed by second-generation entrepreneur, Vishad Mafatlal, who has over 25 years’ experience in textile and chemical sectors", "ratios": {"Market Cap": "₹ 51,325 Cr.", "Current Price": "₹ 10,002", "High / Low": "₹ 10,167 / 5,437", "Stock P/E": "56.0", "Book Value": "₹ 870", "Dividend Yield": "0.15 %", "ROCE": "21.0 %", "ROE": "19.8 %", "Face Value": "₹ 2.00"}, "industry": ["Commodities", "Chemicals", "Chemicals & Petrochemicals", "Specialty Chemicals"], "quarters": {"cols": ["Sep 2023", "Dec 2023", "Mar 2024", "Jun 2024", "Sep 2024", "Dec 2024", "Mar 2025", "Jun 2025", "Sep 2025", "Dec 2025", "Mar 2026", "Jun 2026", "Sep 2026"], "rows": {"Sales": [472.0, 500.0, 602.0, 524.0, 519.0, 606.0, 701.0, 725.0, 758.0, 892.0, 938.0, 1045.0, 1191.0], "YoY Sales growth": [13.0, -11.0, -14.0, 7.0, 10.0, 21.0, 16.0, 39.0, 46.0, 47.0, 34.0, 44.0, 57.0], "Expenses": [373.0, 424.0, 492.0, 423.0, 411.0, 459.0, 522.0, 519.0, 512.0, 585.0, 617.0, 688.0, 783.0], "Operating Profit": [98.0, 76.0, 110.0, 100.0, 107.0, 147.0, 179.0, 207.0, 246.0, 308.0, 321.0, 357.0,